<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="hero themed-hero entry-hero">
    <image class="hero-art" src="/assets/hero/hero-dragon-gate.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image>
    <view class="hero-content">
      <view class="hero-kicker">鱼跃龙门</view>
      <view class="hero-title">高考择校定位</view>
      <view class="hero-lead">
        先定位置，再定学校。重点支持已出分后的填报，也兼容未出分前的预测。
      </view>
      <view class="hero-flow">
        <view class="flow-step">{{scoreMode === 'after_exam' ? '官方位次' : '确认高中'}}</view>
        <view class="flow-line"></view>
        <view class="flow-step">{{scoreMode === 'after_exam' ? '成绩定位' : '校排定位'}}</view>
        <view class="flow-line"></view>
        <view class="flow-step">择校初筛</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-block">
    <view class="section-title">定位参数</view>
    <view class="section-subtitle">
      只保留影响判断的关键参数；定位越清晰，后续学校梯度越可靠。
    </view>

    <view class="field-list">
      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-head">
          <text class="field-label">使用场景</text>
        </view>
        <view class="segmented score-mode">
          <view class="segment {{scoreMode === 'after_exam' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="after_exam" bindtap="handleScoreModeSelect">
            已出分填报
          </view>
          <view class="segment {{scoreMode === 'before_exam' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="before_exam" bindtap="handleScoreModeSelect">
            未出分预测
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="field-tip">已出分时优先填写考试院公布的北京市位次；未出分时再使用校排预测。</view>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{scoreMode === 'after_exam'}}" class="field">
        <view class="field-head">
          <text class="field-label">北京市位次</text>
          <text class="optional">优先填写</text>
        </view>
        <input
          class="field-input"
          type="number"
          placeholder="例如 7804"
          value="{{knownCityRank}}"
          bindinput="handleKnownCityRankInput"
        />
        <view class="field-tip">填写本人官方位次后直接采用，不再经过高中或校排参数调整。</view>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{scoreMode === 'after_exam'}}" class="field">
        <view class="field-head">
          <text class="field-label">最终成绩</text>
          <text class="optional">未填位次时填写</text>
        </view>
        <input
          class="field-input"
          type="number"
          placeholder="例如 645"
          value="{{finalExamScore}}"
          bindinput="handleFinalExamScoreInput"
        />
        <view class="field-tip">使用北京教育考试院 2026 一分一段生成同分位次区间；已知本人确切位次时仍优先填写位次。</view>
      </view>

      <block wx:if="{{scoreMode === 'before_exam'}}">
      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-head">
          <text class="field-label">所在区</text>
          <text class="required">必填</text>
        </view>
        <picker mode="selector" range="{{districtOptions}}" value="{{districtIndex}}" bindchange="handleDistrictChange">
          <view class="field-picker {{districtLabel ? '' : 'placeholder'}}">
            {{districtLabel || '选择学校所在区'}}
          </view>
        </picker>
        <view class="field-tip">当前校排预测覆盖东城、西城、朝阳、海淀、丰台、石景山、通州和大兴；其他区请在已出分后直接填写官方位次或最终成绩。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-head">
          <text class="field-label">就读高中</text>
          <text class="required">必填</text>
        </view>
        <view class="search-box">
          <input
            class="field-input"
            placeholder="输入学校简称或全称，例如：人大附、汇文中学"
            value="{{schoolQuery}}"
            bindinput="handleSchoolQueryInput"
            confirm-type="search"
          />

          <view wx:if="{{searchResults.length > 0}}" class="search-results">
            <view
              wx:for="{{searchResults}}"
              wx:key="school_id"
              class="search-item"
              data-item="{{item}}"
              bindtap="handleSchoolSelect"
            >
              <view class="search-item-top">
                <text class="search-item-name">{{item.short_name}}</text>
                <text class="search-item-score">{{item.matchReasonLabel}}</text>
              </view>
              <view class="search-item-meta">
                {{item.official_name}}｜{{item.district}}｜{{item.entityTypeLabel}}
              </view>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view wx:if="{{selectedSchool.school_id}}" class="selected-school">
          <view class="selected-school-mark">已确认高中</view>
          <view class="selected-school-title">{{selectedSchool.short_name}}</view>
          <view class="selected-school-meta">
            {{selectedSchool.official_name}}｜{{selectedSchool.district}}｜{{selectedSchool.entityTypeLabel}}
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="field two-col-field">
        <view class="half-field">
          <view class="field-head">
            <text class="field-label">校排</text>
            <text class="required">必填</text>
          </view>
          <input
            class="field-input"
            type="number"
            placeholder="例如 120"
            value="{{gradeRank}}"
            bindinput="handleGradeRankInput"
          />
        </view>
        <view class="half-field">
          <view class="field-head">
            <text class="field-label">年级规模</text>
            <text class="required">必填</text>
          </view>
          <input
            class="field-input"
            type="number"
            placeholder="例如 680"
            value="{{gradeTotal}}"
            bindinput="handleGradeTotalInput"
          />
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="field-tip compact-tip">用于换算校内百分位，是定位精度的关键。</view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-head">
          <text class="field-label">校排口径</text>
          <text class="required">必填</text>
        </view>
        <view class="segmented">
          <view class="segment {{rankingBasis === 'same_track' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="same_track" bindtap="handleRankingBasisSelect">
            同类选科
          </view>
          <view class="segment {{rankingBasis === 'full_grade' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="full_grade" bindtap="handleRankingBasisSelect">
            全年级
          </view>
          <view class="segment {{rankingBasis === 'unknown' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="unknown" bindtap="handleRankingBasisSelect">
            暂不确定
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      </block>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-head">
          <text class="field-label">选科组合</text>
          <text class="required">必填</text>
        </view>
        <view class="subject-help">选择 3 门等级考科目，后续将用于匹配院校专业组。</view>
        <view class="subject-grid">
          <view
            wx:for="{{subjectOptions}}"
            wx:key="name"
            class="subject-chip {{item.selected ? 'active' : ''}}"
            data-subject="{{item.name}}"
            bindtap="handleSubjectToggle"
          >
            {{item.name}}
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="subject-summary {{subjectCombination ? 'ready' : ''}}">
          {{subjectCombination ? '已选择：' + subjectCombination.label : selectedSubjects.length > 0 ? '已选 ' + selectedSubjects.length + ' 门：' + subjectCombinationLabel : '选择 3 门科目'}}
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-head">
          <text class="field-label">报考限制条件</text>
          <text class="optional">建议准确填写</text>
        </view>
        <view class="subject-help">用于排除不符合性别、色觉、外语和培养类型要求的专业，不参与身份展示。</view>

        <view class="profile-control">
          <view class="mock-score-label">性别</view>
          <view class="segmented">
            <view class="segment {{gender === 'male' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="gender" data-value="male" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">男生</view>
            <view class="segment {{gender === 'female' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="gender" data-value="female" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">女生</view>
            <view class="segment {{gender === 'unknown' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="gender" data-value="unknown" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">暂不填</view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="profile-control">
          <view class="mock-score-label">色觉情况</view>
          <view class="profile-grid">
            <view class="profile-chip {{colorVision === 'normal' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="colorVision" data-value="normal" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">正常</view>
            <view class="profile-chip {{colorVision === 'color_weak' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="colorVision" data-value="color_weak" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">色弱</view>
            <view class="profile-chip {{colorVision === 'color_blind' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="colorVision" data-value="color_blind" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">色盲</view>
            <view class="profile-chip {{colorVision === 'monochromacy' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="colorVision" data-value="monochromacy" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">单色识别异常</view>
            <view class="profile-chip {{colorVision === 'unknown' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="colorVision" data-value="unknown" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">暂不确定</view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="profile-control">
          <view class="mock-score-label">高考外语</view>
          <view class="segmented">
            <view class="segment {{foreignLanguage === 'english' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="foreignLanguage" data-value="english" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">英语</view>
            <view class="segment {{foreignLanguage === 'other' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="foreignLanguage" data-value="other" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">其他语种</view>
            <view class="segment {{foreignLanguage === 'unknown' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="foreignLanguage" data-value="unknown" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">暂不填</view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="profile-control">
          <view class="mock-score-label">中外合作办学</view>
          <view class="segmented">
            <view class="segment {{acceptCooperative === 'yes' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="acceptCooperative" data-value="yes" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">接受</view>
            <view class="segment {{acceptCooperative === 'no' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="acceptCooperative" data-value="no" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">不接受</view>
            <view class="segment {{acceptCooperative === 'unknown' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-field="acceptCooperative" data-value="unknown" bindtap="handleProfileSelect">暂不确定</view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{scoreMode === 'before_exam'}}" class="field">
        <view class="field-head">
          <text class="field-label">模考分数</text>
          <text class="optional">选填</text>
        </view>
        <view class="mock-score-grid">
          <view class="mock-score-item">
            <text class="mock-score-label">一模</text>
            <input
              class="field-input"
              type="number"
              placeholder="可不填"
              value="{{firstMockScore}}"
              bindinput="handleFirstMockScoreInput"
            />
          </view>
          <view class="mock-score-item">
            <text class="mock-score-label">二模</text>
            <input
              class="field-input"
              type="number"
              placeholder="可不填"
              value="{{secondMockScore}}"
              bindinput="handleSecondMockScoreInput"
            />
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="field-tip">仅记录为预测背景，不直接套用高考一分一段；当前校排模型尚待真实样本回测。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="cta-area">
      <button class="primary-button" bindtap="handleEstimate">生成择校定位</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="info-panel">
    <view class="info-title">为什么先做定位？</view>
    <view class="info-copy">
      高考择校的第一步不是罗列学校，而是确认所处位置。已出分时直接使用北京市位次；未出分时才用校排生成预测区间，再结合选科、历史投档线和当年专业组形成冲稳保梯度。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

